<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>原理收束：这条链为什么这么排</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>04 第二阶段 · 原理</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>本方法不是机制堆叠，而是「诊断 → 机制」的闭环：每一层的存在理由都是一次实测暴露的失效模式。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, gap: 2}}><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#1E4FA8', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 130, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>层</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 260, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>载体 / 环节</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 400, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>它解决哪个失效模式</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 370, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>为什么放在这一步</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 130, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>表达层</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 260, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>cost_vector + 逆映射</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 400, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>连续差分结果没有离散表型，搜索无从评价</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 370, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>提供「归属 × 顺序」的可读翻译，且温度退火兼顾探索与开采</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 130, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>构造层</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 260, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>解码修复链 + 覆盖装载</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 400, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>解不可行 / 幽灵覆盖 / 纸面可行执行弹回</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 370, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>可行性是被造出来的，必须紧跟逆映射、先于评价</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 130, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>评价层</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 260, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>f（覆盖门禁口径）</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 400, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>硬约束被交付收益买穿、完成量被当目标</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 370, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>把「完成是约束」写成合法条件，硬违约层支配其余各层</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 130, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>精修层</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 260, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>polish 三层邻域</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 400, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>收敛曲线早平、路径冗余无人收割</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 370, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>成本项在最底层，交给交付前一次性确定性下降</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 130, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>遗传层</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 260, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>回写比例（默认 0）</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 400, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>修复效益停在表型、逐代重复解码</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 370, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>可用连续比例把修复解写回基因；默认关闭以保证 A/B 逐位可比</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', background: '#FFFFFF', borderBottom: '1px solid #D6DCE5'}}><Box style={{width: 130, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>多样性层</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 260, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>GMR 灭绝 + 台账护栏</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 400, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>早熟、基因型同质化</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 370, justifyContent: 'center', paddingLeft: 9, paddingRight: 9, paddingTop: 6, paddingBottom: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.22, textAlign: 'left' }}>在不改问题目标 f 的前提下守住种群方差，DecisionLedger 逐笔留痕</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 12, gap: 4}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>诚实边界：DE 在 f∘S_eval 上提名精英，交付解经重建与后处理定案；CompareSpec / DecisionLedger / 独立验收已落地，默认 penalty + 纯 Baldwin。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>因此不能写「DE 搜索并选择最优方案」；best_fitness 与 final_fitness 并列报告，选择价值损失与排序反转率如实声明。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>18 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>